                            <p className="text-slate-300 mb-4">
                              Based on the analysis of your submitted document, the technology demonstrates <strong className="text-emerald-300">high novelty</strong> with a uniqueness score of 78%. The invention shows significant advancement over existing prior art in the field of neural network optimization.
                            </p>
                            <h4 className="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Key Findings:</h4>
